! mass_dependence_trackless fixed-ctau CONTROL card: pp -> H2 H2 -> b b~ b b~,
! m_H2 = 170 GeV, ctau FORCED to the mH=150 benchmark value
! 4.32622152973311191 mm (not this point's physical lifetime -- see the
! Phase-5 physical_ctau card for that). Only the mass-dependent production
! sample and 35:m0 differ from cards/r8_h2_model_derived_4b/physical_run_02.cmnd;
! every other setting (shower, jet definition, analysis mode, lifetime
! mechanism, relabel mechanism, Random:seed) is copied unchanged.
! benchmark_id = H2scan_mH170_tb300000 (mission: "MAIN PROMPT" -- Trackless A x eff vs mH)
!
! Production kinematics: g g > H > h2 h2, sqrt(s) = 13 TeV, MadGraph 3.5.3,
! dihiggs_hep_cross results/r14_direct_g_production, run tag s107
! (10000 events generated; the first 1000 are extracted as a genuine
! 1000-event LHE slice via scripts.slice_lhe -- no MadGraph regeneration --
! matching R8's per-seed statistics exactly. r8_geometry_driver enforces an
! exact-event-count invariant on its input, which is why a true 1000-event
! file is used here rather than truncating via Main:numberOfEvents alone.)
!   raw LHE sha256     = 39027dba4e5fa2a537671596bbf784ac32aaa49dc31db1a98bb07dcb94085fa0
!   sliced LHE sha256  = 7c355d8c867bb350d672bc5a8c79be9a01084780949890cf2bcef09f2b26faf2
!   relabelled sha256  = a3b7a1f0edbe1dd4113dda550178a443af28a43f056c382d0808c4ada85b24f3
!
! Relabel mechanism (9000006 -> 35, scripts/relabel_lhe_pdg.py) is byte-for-byte
! the same validated tool used for R8; momenta/status/mothers/colours/mass/
! tau/spin are unchanged, only the IDUP field differs (20000 changes per run
! of 10000 events; verified by the script's own acceptance check).
!
! Shower configuration (FSR on, ISR on, MPI off, hadronization on, Tune:pp =
! 21), jet definition (FastJet kt, R=0.4, pT>20 GeV, unmodified
! Simpler_ToyDetector.cc), and the original/published Trackless analysis mode
! are reused unchanged from the R8/R7 real-recast path. The later `modified`
! Trackless analysis is NOT used here.
Main:numberOfEvents = 1000
Main:timesAllowErrors = 3
Init:showChangedSettings = on
Init:showChangedParticleData = off
Next:numberCount = 5000
Next:numberShowInfo = 0
Next:numberShowProcess = 0
Next:numberShowEvent = 0

Random:setSeed = on
Random:seed = 81002

PartonLevel:MPI = off
PartonLevel:ISR = on
PartonLevel:FSR = on
HadronLevel:Hadronize = on
Tune:pp = 21

Higgs:useBSM = on
35:m0 = 170.
35:mMin = 100.
35:tauCalc = off
35:tau0 = 4.32622152973311191
35:onMode = off
35:onIfMatch = 5 -5

Recast:llpPdgIds = {35}
Recast:llpTau0 = 4.32622152973311191
LesHouches:setLifetime = 2

Beams:frameType = 4
LHEFInputs:nSubruns = 1
Main:subrun = 0
Beams:LHEF = data/raw/mass_dependence_trackless/relabelled_mH170_s107.lhe.gz
